    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 19 Newpark Close is an immaculate 4 bedroom semi-detached house ideally set in a quiet cul de sac in the new Kinsealy Woods Development on Chapel Road just off the Malahide Road. This spacious home boasts a high-end fit-out throughout, an A2 energy rating, fully enclosed side entrance for optimum storage and Bespoke fitted units throughout.\r\n\r\nOn arrival, buyers will notice an enlarged front driveway with bin store. The accommodation consists of an entrance hall with large storage closet, guest wc, spacious living room, bright and airy open plan kitchen / dining & family area. On the first floor there are 4 bedrooms (master ensuite) and a family bathroom. The rear garden is low maintenance with stunning Liscannor stone, replastered garden walls with fencing and garden shed. There is also electricity points, garden light & tap. The attic has a Stira ladder for access and is fully floored and shelved.\r\n\r\nKinsealy Woods is located just a short distance from both Portmarnock and Malahide Village. The M50 & M1 Motorways and Dublin Airport are easily accessible as are bus services to the city centre and Portmarnock Dart Station."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall\t            7.25 x 2.18\t   Decorative timber floor, large storage press, security alarm, Bespoke fitted understair unit with optimal storage\r\n\r\n\t\t\r\nLounge\t      5.15 x 4.2    Feature sliding doors, Bespoke fitted display unit, electric fire, spotlights\r\n\r\n \r\nGuest W.C     1.8 x 1.5\tDecorative timber floor, WC, whb, heated rail\r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen / Family Area\t6.38 x 5.26\tDecorative timber floor, abundance of fitted units, induction hob, extractor fan, dishwasher, full fridge, full freezer, Neff double oven, feature electric fire, spotlights, sliding door to garden\r\n\r\n\t\t\r\nUtility Room\t  2.56 x 1.82\tPlumbed for washer & dryer, door to side passage, fitted units\r\n \r\n \r\nStairs / Landing\t4.3 x 1.75\tStira ladder access to huge attic suitable for conversion, fitted storage press\r\n\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 1\t3.36 x 3.07\tFitted wardrobes\r\n\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 2\t3.36 x 3.2\tFitted wardrobes\r\n\r\n\t\t\r\nShower Room\t2 x 1.75\tTiled floor & partial walls, walk in shower, mirrored cabinet, wc, whb, holders \r\n\r\n\t\t\r\nMaster bedroom\t4.87 x 3.82\tDecorative timber floor, abundance of fitted wardrobes\r\nincluding ensuite\t\t                Tiled floor & partial walls, wc, whb, mirror, vanity unit, walk in shower, shelving\r\n\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 4\t5 x 1.90\tBuilt in bed (fold out), abundance of Fitted wardrobes\r\n \r\n\r\nRear Garden                Liscannor stone, fenced and walled, steel shed, light, tap, fully enclosed side passage for optimum secure storage"
      },
